4109\", \"row_ids\": {\"cn\": \"TE-072\", \"r_ca_o\": \"TE-072\"}, \"rule\": \"best-grade full-text ca_hydration_number row; CN rounded to an integer; Ca-O is the Ca-Ow distance printed in the same row\"}, \"chain\": {\"conformer\": \"n6_MMFF94_it5000_seed3\", \"conformer_record\": \"oligomer_conformers.json\", \"generated_on\": {\"machine\": \"arm64\", \"system\": \"Darwin\"}}, \"slab\": {\"bulk\": \"mp-1143\", \"database\": \"Materials Project\", \"database_version\": \"2026.04.13\", \"structure_sha256\": \"ec398689a7ded01be6b87883de0b219483f7d06317e6fef9f1495b5e870dc75a\"}}" total_charge=0 illustrative=T label="illustrative construction for a schematic figure; not a simulated structure" notes="illustrative construction: hydroxylated alumina, anchored catechol oligomers, a few Ca2+ at template sites, an amorphous CaCO3 nucleus as a lens of flat base on the template, a bridging Ca2+ under its rim, dissolved carbonate for charge balance, water above the template" drawing_choices="{\"acc_min_distances\": \"Ca-Ca 3.4, Ca-C 2.9, Ca-O 2.3, C-C 3.0, O-O 2.5 A exclusion distances of the insertion (drawing rule)\", \"acc_structural_water\": \"the structural water of ACC (0.5-1.1 H2O per CaCO3 in the sourced rows) is not drawn\", \"base_height\": \"11 A, the lens base resting on the catechol layer (chain tops at 12-13 A)\", \"base_radius\": \"15 A lens base radius, chosen so the lens reads as a cap rather than a cluster\", \"chain\": \"generic 4-unit 5,6-dihydroxyindole chain, MMFF94 conformer, rigid body (structure of the layer is debated)\", \"contact_angle_deg\": \"50 degrees, an illustration of the partial wetting that W3's analysis allows (not a result)\", \"placements\": \"chain sites and azimuths, dissolved carbonate positions and the lens centre are composition choices\", \"slab\": \"bulk corundum spacings, unrelaxed; OH 0.97 A tilted 15 degrees\", \"water\": \"random sequential insertion at 1 g/cm3, rigid gas-phase geometry, not equilibrated\"}" charge_ledger="[[\"